//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"54526","date":"2026-02-20T13:30:36+00:00","text":"2026年2月20日18时海洋天气公报 - mot.gov.cn","image":"//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918F.png","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"54525","date":"2026-02-20T13:23:51+00:00","text":"新春走基层丨乌鲁木齐年味正浓 - ts.cn","image":"//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F94A5.png","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"54524","date":"2026-02-20T13:19:35+00:00","text":"7名中国游客在俄贝加尔湖溺亡 - 新华网","image":"//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F94A5.png","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"54523","date":"2026-02-20T13:15:34+00:00","text":"“中美战机一度在黄海上空对峙” - 观察","image":"//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F998F.png","video":"","hasVideo":false}],"microsoft":[{"id":"381","date":"2025-03-20T18:28:54+00:00","text":"","image":"//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F93B1.png","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"379","date":"2025-03-19T10:49:35+00:00","text":"📱 Microsoft Aims to Create Brain-Like AI Microsoft has teamed up with Swiss AI startup Inait to develop a new AI model that mimics a mammal's brain. Instead of traditional methods like pattern recognition and statistical analysis, Inait's approach uses a \"brain programming language\" framework. This framework lets digital brains process information, learn from experience, understand cause and effect, and adjust how they learn. The partnership also aims to build industrial robots that can adapt to complex environments, which could change manufacturing and automation processes. In the finance sector, the collaboration focuses on developing sophisticated trading algorithms, risk management tools, and personalized financial advice systems. Read More","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/sLgyRA98tZeU60KWJf6OHSo6F5RWyTC_GcTjaTgJ3EGCRumjX-11A_JULJ3nY7U2Z26FnSGlaGJALUpjyvQ_7GmuXK9prnrUJVL3Q4hZDAOqEQed6eYPoepptOPIE5eXs6rtLf2gDDTC4aSesRWaCNB6LXc70K4mMqE4RpehFL4OL-Nj7LalHdCIoXX_HAWkeWHVo6H_vRTTvpEgCMGY088EJiEPajmpm25rfwECt_GkdcBmj844IuqmUiIpX-2aF_qhhZ3il4KuJtggR0ZiNovBhmF6kgxKfABgmON9X5deTLmwPdEEFTv11eyr4Esg9YzCOj0bVleo7DCWAkNtQw.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"378","date":"2025-03-11T22:04:26+00:00","text":"Paid Reactions Test Post","image":"//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"376","date":"2025-02-20T16:36:49+00:00","text":"🖼️ Microsoft Unveils Majorana 1: A New Era for Quantum Computing Microsoft today introduced Majorana 1, a groundbreaking quantum chip designed with a revolutionary Topological Core architecture . This innovation could bring us closer to quantum computers capable of solving large-scale, real-world problems in just a few years instead of decades. It leverages the world’s first topoconductor , a breakthrough type of material that can observe and control Majorana particles to produce more reliable and scalable qubits — the building blocks for quantum computers. In the same way that the invention of semiconductors made today’s smartphones, computers, and electronics possible, topoconductors and the new type of chip they enable offer a path to developing quantum systems that can scale to a million qubits and are capable of tackling the most complex industrial and societal problems, Microsoft said. Read More","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/Hm2zhI5msuEGsiQE_2QSd1anSC4YxCI-NFrJDwWPJwf-ZRvRj2OYW9MnYM6IY2Eu0I0qTAecDN2__2zVuZ49XYB3xQ83qYXbQ2YX_DRFhwLMUWKnSUFaP7QbU3onMqd9yUmOYFhn97FbWfnVZ2JnVrcwQw54fQK8hiOgewGlfzLYTWcFUiAKrblRZvArmba9QBvKZ3jXzabmy5_HV5LBb54GtVXvpOxpDlxMf1pFBUXj9SpJZyP18CLC1WntQl8z-HZFWU3HMkl6kpc81t6N1ok8QXjwcWbJF_wWpY-gmd_pSNaw72ONPSQhOVT_-qx0F5RhNxSk_5p3AeH_ZrLxzg.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"234","date":"2024-01-08T08:10:10+00:00","text":"Introducing new Windows 11 features for a comfortable and productive workplace. With the latest updates, users will have access to features such as an optimized taskbar with the option to turn on and mute calls, the ability to display weather and time information, and two updated applications - No